// An arcane bolt's trail in flight (kit/effects.rs; spell.rs sweeps the strip along each
// bolt's path and lights it with the bolt's own two lights): a streak, as Path of Exile's
// and Diablo IV's projectiles are drawn, a white-hot line down its middle in a soft blue
// halo narrowing down the trail, the tail eroded into streaks, no hard border. It replaces
// spell.rs's two flat additive ribbons (blue 8 and white 16 linear, cut sharp at their
// edges: the judges' "hard crescent sprites"). At the ruin's ev100 8 (exposure 1/307) the
// line is ~11 linear, the halo ~2.6 in blue.
(
    cue: Bolt,
    at: Hero,
    still: 0.0,
    life: 0.5,
    trail: (core: Srgb(0.85, 0.92, 1.0), core_nits: 3500.0, rim: Srgb(0.3, 0.55, 1.0), rim_nits: 800.0,
        width: 0.16, smear: 1.0, tail: 1.3, soft: 0.2, streak: true),
)
